OL,3,GNEWSANext stage of Castle Mona
OL,4,Arestoration approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to replace the central roof of
OL,7,Fthe former Castle Mona hotel in Douglas
OL,8,Fand demolish part of the historic
OL,9,Fbuilding have been approved.
OL,11,FThe registered building, which dates
OL,12,Fback to 1804, closed as a hotel in 2006
OL,13,Fand was bought at auction for #1.21m in
OL,14,F2018 by developer Tevir.
OL,16,FThe rear of the site, including the
OL,17,Fsouth-west wing, will be knocked down
OL,18,Fto "facilitate space for a modern
OL,19,Fbuilding".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
