OL,3,GNEWSANext stage of Castle Mona
OL,4,Arestoration approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is not yet clear what the purpose of
OL,7,Fthe restored site will be, but the
OL,8,Fowners hope the site can perform "a
OL,9,Fcivic function of some form."
